ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them. In 2025 that same pair ran 59% of normal on the middle, and September to October ran 47%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 216% of normal on the middle and May to June at 59%. Grid 28668 had its driest year in 1958 at 65%.</p>"}
